---
title: Sesame Spinach
servings: 2
prep time: 30 minutes
cook time: 3 hours
tags:
  - snack
  - vegetarian
  - short
  - light
---

Wash @spinach{100-150%g} thoroughly.

Bring water in a pot to a boil.

Add spinach and blanch for approximately ~{30-45%seconds}.

Immediately transfer to cold water.

Chop or leave as is and add crushed @sesame seeds{1%tbsp}, @soy sauce{1%tsp},
@sugar{0.5%tsp}, and @sesame oil{0.5%tsp}.
